Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:21.66,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:21.66,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}菲斯 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}3 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}1-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}0{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 蒂亚福 · 赛后捧杯致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,女士们，先生们，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:05.40,EN,,0,0,0,,your champion is Sir Arthur Fils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:05.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们的冠军是——亚瑟·菲斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:12.40,EN,,0,0,0,,To present Arthur with that Rookwood Cup,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,为亚瑟颁发这尊奖杯的，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:12.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,鲍勃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:16.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Bob Moran.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,·莫兰。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:20.84,EN,,0,0,0,,And Arthur, we'd love to hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚瑟，我们想听你说几句。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,好，轮到我了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家好。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, first I have to start with with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先，我想先说说你，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:35.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, man, it's good to be to be here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,说真的，能站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to play a final against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟你打这场决赛，真好。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, when I was young,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道吗，我小时候，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:39.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I was watching you a lot on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,经常在电视上看你打球。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:40.96,EN,,0,0,0,,You are one of the guy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是那种
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:44.08,EN,,0,0,0,,that that make me turn on the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,会让我专门打开电视看的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.08,0:00:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm very very happy to see a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.08,0:00:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以，能打出这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.48,EN,,0,0,0,,of nice battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,精彩的对攻，我特别开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Of course, congrats to the team as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然，也要恭喜你的团队。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:55.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.04,0:00:56.72,EN,,0,0,0,,you guys are making unbelievable job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.04,0:00:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们做得太出色了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.52,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you. Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们，恭喜。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:04.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Now I want to to thanks the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在我想谢谢现场的观众。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, even if today you were not cheering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,就算今天你们没有为我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.24,0:01:10.84,EN,,0,0,0,,for me, but that was a hell of a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.24,0:01:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,加油，这一周也太精彩了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:21.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Now I want to say thanks to my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在我想谢谢我的团队。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean guys, unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的，你们太了不起了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I have no words I cannot say except thank
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不知道还能说什么，只能说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.32,0:01:26.64,EN,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.32,0:01:26.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.64,0:01:27.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.64,0:01:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,太谢谢你们了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Eva and Lapo, Hank, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢伊娃、拉波、汉克。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:33.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Back in Europe, we made a hell of a job
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:33.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,在欧洲，我们下了很大功夫，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.52,0:01:37.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.52,0:01:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且还没有结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:43.52,EN,,0,0,0,,And, you know, I've been traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道吗，这段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.68,EN,,0,0,0,,with my dad every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直带着爸爸满世界跑。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:48.16,EN,,0,0,0,,He he's not here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:48.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,他现在不在这儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.16,0:01:50.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I won the trophy, but I would just want
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.16,0:01:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我拿到了奖杯，但我还是想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:52.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to say thanks to him as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:52.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟他说一声谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:53.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks to all my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:53.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢我所有的家人。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:54.32,EN,,0,0,0,,They are back in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们都在欧洲。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:57.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,And of course, just to finish,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:03.28,EN,,0,0,0,,thanks to Cincinnati,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢辛辛那提，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,thanks to the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢这项赛事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:06.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's been a hell of a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:06.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周太精彩了，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:10.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and I will come back next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:10.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,明年我还会回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:13.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Arthur, if I can get you to stand right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚瑟，请你站到这儿来，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:14.80,EN,,0,0,0,,hold that trophy up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:14.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,把奖杯高高举起。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:16.96,EN,,0,0,0,,May I present to you everybody your 2026
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,有请——2026 年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:19.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Cincinnati Open men's singles champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:19.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提公开赛男单冠军，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:21.66,EN,,0,0,0,,Arthur Fils.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:21.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚瑟·菲斯。
